// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Christian Burkard (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-08-30
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
// Description: Detects the pattern of UAC Bypass using a path parsing issue in winsat.exe (UACMe 52)
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((IntegrityLevel EQUALS "High" OR IntegrityLevel EQUALS "System" OR IntegrityLevel EQUALS "S-1-16-16384" OR IntegrityLevel EQUALS "S-1-16-12288") AND ParentImage="*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\system32\\winsat.exe" AND ParentCommandLine CONTAINS "C:\\Windows \\system32\\winsat.exe")
